***************************************************************
*********************** SAMPLE RUNS ***************************
***************************************************************

set cgwh = /home/henshw/research/cgwave/bin/cgwh
alias /home/henshw/Overture.g/bin/ogen ogen
alias /home/henshw/Overture.g/bin/plotStuff plotStuff

++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++=+++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
Scattering from a disk

make the grid:
  ogen -noplot cicArg -order=2 -interp=e -factor=4   ( creates cice4.order2.hdf )

Run: 
$cgwh scat.cmd -g=cice4.order2 -ts=implicit -cfl=1000 -nf=1 -amp=1 -kx=4 -ky=0 -kz=0 -adjustOmega=1 -orderInTime=2 -solver=none -tol=1e-12 -upwind=0 -maxIterations=70 -numPeriods=4 -filterTimeDerivative=1 -damp=0 -bc=d -bc1=a -bc2=a -bc3=a -bc4=a -debug=0 -eigenVectorFile=none -show=scatCylO2G4kx4.show -takeImplicitFirstStep=1 -matlab=cicG4O2kx4Brrrrd -go=halt

Choose dialog buttons:
  o solve Helmholtz directly
  o zero initial condition
  o compute with krylov 
  o save show file
  o exit

To see the total field: 
    plotStuff scatCylO2G4kx4.show

CgWaveHoltz::residual (complex): omega=  25.132741229, max-rel-res=[Re,Im]=[1.495e-12,1.119e-12].
solveHelmholtz: max-rel-residual [Re,Im]=[1.49e-12,1.12e-12] (gmres, numIts=54, ave-CR= 0.62 , cpu=4.51e+00(s), np=1)
solveHelmholtz: rel-max-diff [Re,Im]=[8.47e-12,7.73e-12],  norm [Re,Im]=[1.16e+00,1.12e+00] (between WaveHoltz and Direct Helmholtz)


++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++=+++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 Scattering from three holes:

Grid: (cgwave/grids/holeCollectionGrid.cmd)
ogen -noplot holeCollectionGrid.cmd -prefix=threeHolesGrid -order=4 -interp=e -blf=2 -innerRad=0.35 -periodic=nn -xa=-2 -nCylx=2 -nCyly=1 -deltaX=1 -deltaY=1 -offsetColumns=1 -factor=4 

Run 
$cgwh scat.cmd -g=threeHolesGridN2M1e4.order4 -ts=implicit -cfl=1000 -nf=1 -amp=1 -kx=1 -ky=0 -kz=0 -adjustOmega=1 -orderInTime=2 -solver=none -tol=1e-10 -upwind=0 -maxIterations=70 -numPeriods=4 -filterTimeDerivative=1 -damp=0 -bc=d -bc1=a -bc2=a -bc3=a -bc4=a -debug=0 -eigenVectorFile=none -show=threeHolesG8O4Scatkx4.show -takeImplicitFirstStep=1 -matlab=threeHolesG4O4Scatkx1 -go=halt

Choose dialog buttons:
  o solve Helmholtz directly
  o zero initial condition
  o compute with krylov 
  o save show file
  o exit

To see the total field: 
    plotStuff threeHolesG8O4Scatkx4.show

solveHelmholtz: max-rel-residual [Re,Im]=[2.25e-09,2.85e-10] (gmres, numIts=15, ave-CR= 0.24 , cpu=3.42e+00(s), np=1)
solveHelmholtz: rel-max-diff [Re,Im]=[8.91e-11,8.61e-11],  norm [Re,Im]=[1.56e+00,1.08e+00] (between WaveHoltz and Direct Helmholtz)
